  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Dark Reading Room",
    "overview": "A private meeting workspace gives transcripts a generous, quiet surface. Dark forest-tinted neutrals and restrained green actions support reading; editorial serif titles distinguish the workspace from its practical sans-serif controls and transcript.\n\nThe dark adaptation is the approved new direction. The existing light theme remains available and retains its inherited blue accents and pale surfaces; it shares the updated layout and heading treatment, but is not a light version of the dark palette.",
